\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li0 - Look Ahead: delaying from the BANNER doesn't show the "\u9654? Delayed"\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 line on the tile (your #61-build phone test). Reading the code\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 found the likely cause: the page only re-reads its saved items\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 when it first opens, so a banner delay done while the page was\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 already loaded never appears \u8212? and can even be lost. The Delay\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 button ON the tile is fine. Fix is small (re-read on every visit).\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 Also checked: a Delay is NOT supposed to write a log entry \u8212?\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 only Done logs. That part is by design.\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 #4-new: that fix is now in \u8212? Look Ahead re-reads on every visit.\par
\pard\sa0\sl276\slmult1\li240 Very likely cured, but unconfirmed until the phone says so.\par
